## UT-006: Metadata and Documentation

**Scope**: Test class metadata and documentation

**Metadata Requirements**:
- Generate `.cls-meta.xml` with current Salesforce API version
- Include class-level comments describing test purpose
- Document complex test scenarios

**Example Metadata**:
```xml
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<ApexClass xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <apiVersion>59.0</apiVersion>
    <status>Active</status>
</ApexClass>
```

